(:id "go/R16" :state :unknown :note "\"the bounds pass counts a forged ordinal remapped to None on BOTH plans; copy/const/present/ordinal move nothing\": the go leg counts a forged ordinal and unguarded None const inside the ordinal and const ops (tableFixedOrdinal and tableFixedConst in fixedruntime.go) rather than in the bounds pass, so ordinal and const move Clamped and the clause is not held on this leg")
(:id "go/R18" :state :unknown :note "\"a clamp that cannot fire is not emitted\": the ranged-scalar end on its width's limit and a bits(N) below its storage width are elided and asserted, but a full-width enum/union ordinal clamp (255 variants in a byte) IS emitted as the tautology docs/FIXED-FORM-ALGORITHM.md §5.4 calls \"still conforming\", so the ordinal half of the clause is not held on this leg")
